apache/superset/commit/7260916b905bbcc9d7b950a72838bb6cb97f0638","commit_subject":"test(dashboard): cover \"View as table\" end-to-end for a view-as-table-only role (#44881)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"MatterHackers/agg-sharp","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-03T02:42:23Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"71de5dd0c60e324d674d0b3231b02f22bc78621f","github_link":"https://github.com/MatterHackers/agg-sharp/commit/71de5dd0c60e324d674d0b3231b02f22bc78621f","commit_subject":"Accepting a suggestion is one undo step: InternalTextEditWidget.ReplaceRange(start, length, text) (passed through on TextEditWidget) replaces a clamped range, ends the selection, puts the caret after the insert, raises TextChanged and records exactly one undo step; TextSuggestionController.Accept uses it instead of setting Text, which took no step. Text-field undo itself was off by one: each step held only the state after its edit and restored that same state for undo and redo, so the first Ctrl+Z after any edit did nothing and redo returned the undone state. Steps now hold the state before and after (TextWidgetUndoCommand + TextEditState), recorded by the new TextEditUndoHistory, and a program setting Text makes that text where the next step's undo lands. InternalTextEditWidget also hands its word/line caret helpers (word-break sets, IndexOfNextToken/IndexOfPreviousToken, start of line, line extents) to the internal static TextCaretNavigation; the public statics stay as forwarders. InternalTextEditWidget.cs drops from 1537 to 1398 non-empty lines and its frozen limit is lowered to match. TextEditUndoTests and TextSuggestionControllerTests.AcceptIsItsOwnUndoStep pin it.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ClickHouse/ClickHouse","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-03T02:42:23Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"3a0548b1996886392294d3b94ed5870bef6f05dc","github_link":"https://github.com/ClickHouse/ClickHouse/commit/3a0548b1996886392294d3b94ed5870bef6f05dc","commit_subject":"Lift max_rows_to_read for the 05317 fixtu